{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Silent Stay \u2013 Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the unsettling first moments of <i>Silent Stay</i>, a narrative horror game with psychological elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you step into the beginning of Alex Miller\u2019s story:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A haunting nightmare</strong> sets the tone, plunging you straight into unease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arrival at the cabin</strong> immerses you in silence and isolation \u2013 though subtle details already suggest something is not quite right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First disturbing occurrences</strong> plant the seeds of dread that will grow throughout the chapters to come.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the oppressive atmosphere, uncover subtle clues, and taste the psychological horror in its earliest stages \u2013 before the true nightmare begins.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964310?t=1756142166","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964310?t=1756142166","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964310/968268b395a53365811cf847b525ab295f552f4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756142166","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964310/968268b395a53365811cf847b525ab295f552f4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756142166","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Silent Stay contains themes of death as well as depictions of violence, blood, and intense fear. Player discre